                        "entry_id": "4c6ab870-9641-3340-91b5-02e33deb0a59",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Wearing too many clothes for the weather or the occasion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a95d2a8a-c589-46ed-b9fa-125fbd4f1149",
                                "sense_id": "3cd4d3d9-1a5c-3255-9f91-65d30185d1a5",
                                "text": "Almost all babies get heat rash during hot weather. However, heat rash can occur even in cold weather if your child is overdressed either during the daytime or the nighttime."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f08a5425-fe24-39df-ab4f-c588afc90cd6",
                        "entry_id": "4c6ab870-9641-3340-91b5-02e33deb0a59",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Wearing clothes too formal or too elaborate for the occasion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2eb70595-9c44-4387-9914-f9325ee2eeac",
                                "sense_id": "f08a5425-fe24-39df-ab4f-c588afc90cd6",
                                "text": "Not, a thousand times not, that she should be overdressed. An overdressed Angel is a contradiction in terms. We associate not angelic attributes with the gorgeous attire and plenipotent jewellery of a Houndsditch Hebrewess. Just as the man who is got up in the loudest of loud costumes, and hangs out as a sort of Christmas tree, with incongruous braveries and charms and nicknacks pendent all over, we are apt to deem not a gentleman, but a gent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d27c0b13-72d7-4723-b6ec-8d8e0bf98489",
                                "sense_id": "f08a5425-fe24-39df-ab4f-c588afc90cd6",
                                "text": "\"I was worried you might think I am overdressed,\" Sheinna replied in a small voice."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
